From: Han Gao <gaohan@iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Wed, 2 Oct 2024 01:14:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 213/654] config: enable landlock

Signed-off-by: Han Gao <gaohan@iscas.ac.cn>
Signed-off-by: Han Gao <rabenda.cn@gmail.com>
---
 arch/riscv/configs/win2030_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/win2030_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/win2030_defconfig
index 3f122dd04f2f..801434d707a2 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/configs/win2030_defconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/configs/win2030_defconfig
@@ -795,6 +795,7 @@ CONFIG_SECURITY=y
 CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX=y
 CONFIG_SECURITY_SELINUX_BOOTPARAM=y
 CONFIG_SECURITY_APPARMOR=y
+CONFIG_SECURITY_LANDLOCK=y
 CONFIG_DEFAULT_SECURITY_APPARMOR=y
 CONFIG_LSM="landlock,lockdown,yama,integrity,apparmor"
 CONFIG_CRYPTO_CBC=m
